%% fsm-contract: {"eventType":"insulin","askedFields":["dose","insulinType","doseContext"],"path":["dose","insulinType","doseContext","optional-context","stored"],"globalStateChange":false,"lifecycleChange":false,"emergencyImpact":true,"priorityImpact":false,"doseRecommendation":false}
%% Same shape as meal.mmd's fsm-contract; not yet enforced by test/fsm_mermaid_contract_test.dart.
flowchart TD
  INPUT[Insulin event from user or parser] --> DOSE[Ask units applied]
  DOSE --> TYPE[Ask insulin type: rapida, basal, or pre-misturada]
  TYPE --> DOSE_CONTEXT[Ask if dose was correction, meal-coverage, or basal/routine]
  DOSE_CONTEXT --> CONTEXT[Offer optional context]
  CONTEXT --> STORE[Store insulin event]
  STORE --> SIGNAL[Feeds recentInsulin signal to EmergencyEngine]

  NOTE[Generic missing-field collection only: no new DiabAIGlobalState, EventStatus, priority rule, dose calculation, or medical recommendation. insulinType and doseContext are plain FieldSpec entries like dose, so they can also be pre-filled passively from the parser's insulin_type entity before being asked.]
  BACKLOG[Roadmap backlog, not implemented: insulin-on-board tracking, dedicated history view, dose suggestions. Any of these that add dose calculation or clinical reasoning stay out of scope per AGENTS.md.]
